================================================================================
Pint (unit conversion)
================================================================================

Sources/FormatoCore/FormatoUnits.swift ports Pint's to_compact rule as RosettaSciIO
uses it, and Sources/FormatoCore/FormatoUnitsFactors.swift carries Pint 0.26.1's
conversion factors between SI-prefixed units, generated by
tools/step-1/pint_factors.py.

